# NOTE: frontend/generated/eligible-registrants.json is intentionally NOT
# ignored. It has to be committed and pushed to main so GitHub Pages
# actually serves it — otherwise apply.html (and the Organiser Desk) can
# never see the current eligible-address list, because the file they
# fetch simply isn't there on the live site.
#
# deployments/ is also intentionally NOT ignored — deployments/sepolia.json
# is how the CI/CD pipeline's "did the deployed address change?" diff and
# the frontend's config.js sync stay honest across runs.
